# C4-level idle: trivial pass-through.
#
# In the c4c6 qodec, error correction is performed at the C6 layer (see
# c6/idle.gadget.yaml), where Knill's teleportation EC network is
# realized from middle-layer (C4-encoded) primitives. The C4 layer —
# being the leaf of the encoded hierarchy in this qodec — has no
# further encoding to build EC against, so `idle` just hands its input
# through unchanged.

